"bgcolor": "#000", "size": [428.1044921875, 620.2369995117188], "pos": [185.9502410888672, 478.8433837890625], "id": 45, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Nano_Banana2_Image2Image"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#222", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["**第一步：视觉解码与品牌分析 (Visual & Brand Analysis)**\n\n1.  **产品类目 (Product_Category):** 高端家用厨电 / 多功能料理锅 / 鸳鸯电火锅。属于“精致家居生活”或“高端厨房电器”行业。\n2.  **视觉描述 (Visual_Description):** 产品主体为深咖啡色与黑色撞色的圆形电火锅，拥有宽大的防烫把手。核心特征是内部的“鸳鸯锅”设计（S型分隔），一边是红油飘香的麻辣汤底（漂浮着红辣椒、花椒、豆腐），另一边是浓郁的奶白色菌汤底（漂浮着香菇、红枣、葱段）。底部控制面板带有明显的金色/香槟色装饰条，显示有温度滑杆和“火锅/烧烤”模式，整体散发着厚重的金属质感与高级的电器光泽。\n3.  **品牌调性 (Brand_Vibe):** 温暖治愈的、日式匠心的、家庭聚会的幸福感、高端且实用的。\n4.  **理想场景 (Ideal_Environment):** 一个布置温馨的现代家庭餐厅，木质餐桌，背景是虚化的温暖室内灯光，窗外可能是冬日的深蓝夜色，营造出“回家吃饭”的温馨氛围。\n5.  **光影风格 (Lighting_Style):** 电影级美食布光。主光柔和打在模特面部，辅光重点照亮火锅内的汤汁使其看起来油润诱人，利用逆光勾勒出升腾的热气（Steam），增加食欲感。\n6.  **亚洲模特画像 (Model_Persona):** 28岁左右的亚洲都市女性，妆容清透自然（水光肌），穿着质感柔软的米色或浅驼色羊绒毛衣，头发随意挽起或自然披散，气质温婉贤淑，享受生活的松弛感。\n7.  **交互动作 (Interaction_Mode):** 模特坐在桌前，身体微微前倾，手持长筷刚刚夹起一块食物（或正准备夹取），眼神聚焦在锅中翻滚的食材上，嘴角带着满足和期待的微笑，享受着烹饪的乐趣。\n\n---\n\n**第二步：变量标准化 (Variable Definition)**\n\n*   **{THE_PRODUCT}:** A high-end Zojirushi electric hot pot with a split yin-yang divider, deep brown metallic body, digital slider control panel at the base. Inside the pot, boiling split soup bases: left side is spicy red oil broth with floating chili peppers and tofu, right side is creamy white bone broth with mushrooms and jujubes. Realistic steam rising, appetizing food texture, metallic reflection.\n*   **{THE_MODEL}:** A beautiful 28-year-old Asian woman, glowing skin, natural premium makeup, wearing a cozy beige cashmere sweater, elegant and relaxed vibe, soft smile.\n*   **{THE_INTERACTION}:** Sitting at a wooden dining table, holding chopsticks, leaning slightly forward towards the hot pot, looking at the boiling food with anticipation and happiness.\n*   **{THE_SCENE}:** A cozy, modern dining room interior, warm ambient lighting, blurred background with bokeh lights, wooden texture table, winter evening atmosphere.\n*   **{THE_VIBE}:** Commercial photography, 8k resolution, cinematic lighting, appetizing, depth of field, warm color palette, high fidelity, advertising masterpiece, shot on Hasselblad.\n\n---\n\n**第三步：输出 KV 级大片提示词 (Hero Shot Prompt)**\n\n**High-end commercial photography, hero shot of a sophisticated 28-year-old Asian woman in a cozy beige cashmere sweater, sitting at a warm wooden dining table. She is smiling gently, holding chopsticks, interacting with a premium Zojirushi electric hot pot placed in the center. The hot pot features a split yin-yang divider containing bubbling spicy red chili broth on one side and rich white mushroom broth on the other, filled with gourmet ingredients like tofu and red dates. Realistic steam rising from the pot, highlighting the appetizing texture of the food. Cinematic lighting with warm tones, softbox lighting on the model's face, rim light accentuating the steam and the metallic dark brown texture of the appliance. Depth of field, bokeh background of a modern home dining room in the evening, 8k resolution, ultra-realistic, advertising grade quality.**"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 109, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [879.1599731445312, 611.9732055664062], "pos": [-261.2069396972656, 1166.6636962890625], "id": 87, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "color": "#222", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 60, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "