遮住一只眼睛，或是在运动中自然抓握）\n第二步：变量标准化(Variable Definition)\n为了确保 AI 图片生成的质量，请将第一步分析出的信息，转化为用于绘画的英文关键词变量。请定义以下 3 个英文变量模块：\n{THE_PRODUCT}: 产品外观的英文详细描述。\n{THE_MODEL}: 亚洲模特的特征描述（年龄、妆造、表情）。\n{THE_INTERACTION}: 模特与产品的具体动作关联。\n{THE_SCENE}: 理想场景的英文详细描述。\n{THE_VIBE}: 品牌调性、光影风格及构图（如：Medium shot, Close-up）。\n第三步：输出 KV 级大片提示词（纯英文提示词）请基于以上分析，整合为一个专业的 Hero Shot 提示词。\n重要要求：输出纯文本。\n现在，请开始分析上传的图片，保持产品一致性，不要有多余的解释，直接输出结果："], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 104, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 105, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "link": 106, "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "link": 107, "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_Captioner_Pro", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [432.7435607910156, 617.9722900390625], "pos": [-259.9434509277344, 479.9369812011719], "id": 88, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner_Pro"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [64, 103, 104], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [], "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#222", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["6d823a7c06b187eb4aabbe85e3fb4c8f914d75b2ec55a8109c6004dfdc2ac844.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "